    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### RAG Chatbot – Setup Instructions\n\n1. **Google Drive:** Create a `Company RAG Documents` folder and configure OAuth2 credentials. Connect both triggers to detect new and updated files.\n\n2. **Gemini Embeddings:** Add your Google Gemini API credential and select `models/gemini-embedding-001` in both embedding nodes.\n\n3. **Pinecone:** Configure your API credential and select the `company-files` index in both vector store nodes. Ensure the index dimension matches the embedding output.\n\n4. **OpenRouter:** Add your API credential and select an available chat model in both OpenRouter nodes. Connect them to the AI Agent and Vector Store Tool.\n\n5. **Import Workflow:** Import the workflow JSON into n8n, configure your credentials and resources, then save.\n\n6. **Ingest Documents:** Upload a PDF to Google Drive and verify that it is downloaded, split into chunks, embedded, and stored in Pinecone.\n\n7. **Test Chatbot:** Ask questions about the uploaded document and verify that answers match the source content.",
        "height": 608,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
